  "releaseHighlights": "- The four photographic test images are back: Blue Bar, Red Christmas Lights, Light Saber and Diver. Each one now just names its colour space and says where a poor picture formation breaks the picture. The download is about 51 MB again.\n- Image Options gains a DaVinci Wide Gamut / Intermediate output. ARRI Wide Gamut 4 (Diver), Rec.709 and sRGB sources are converted to DaVinci Wide Gamut and encoded with the Intermediate curve, no clamp, so the node drops straight into a DWG/I timeline.\n- Palette Reconstruction gains a Sampled From Image preset. It reads the frame every render, finds the colours that cover most of it and fills the palette in coverage order, Colour 1 being the most common. Colour Count still sets how many.",
